# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to build MnemoScript with Google Drive sync enabled.
# Create an OAuth client of type "Desktop app" in your own Google Cloud project with the
# Drive API enabled and the https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata scope on the
# consent screen. Google documents a desktop client secret as not confidential, but keep
# this file out of git anyway. Rebuild after changing it.
MNEMO_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
MNEMO_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
